[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in polar form as \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\), where \(\theta\) is a real number. This ensures that \(|z| = 4\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m The expression then becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m (75 + 117i) \cdot 4e^{i\theta} + \frac{96 + 144i}{4e^{i\theta}} = 4(75 + 117i)e^{i\theta} + \frac{96 + 144i}{4}e^{-i\theta}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m = 4(75 + 117i)e^{i\theta} + (24 + 36i)e^{-i\theta}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1488992)[0m \[
